{
  "_readme": [
    "AGARTALA — the template filled in. Rename to doctors.json to use.",
    "",
    "VERIFY EVERY NUMBER BY CALLING IT BEFORE ANYONE RELIES ON THIS FILE.",
    "",
    "WHAT THIS IS, AND WHAT IT IS NOT",
    "The template has one blank row per speciality and asks for a named doctor,",
    "a mobile, a WhatsApp number and an assistant. None of that is published",
    "anywhere checkable. What is published — and what is here — is institutions,",
    "their departments, and their switchboards. Every name below is a department",
    "at a real hospital, which is also what a patient has to ask for at reception;",
    "'ask for the Orthopaedics OPD at IGM' is actionable, and a doctor's name",
    "copied off a listings site is stale within a month and may be a private",
    "mobile its owner never published.",
    "",
    "So the four institutions below cover all fifteen specialities between them.",
    "Add named doctors on top as you confirm them one by one, by phone.",
    "",
    "VERIFIED from official or first-party sources (August 2026):",
    "  IGM Hospital, IGM Chowmuhani, AK Road, Agartala 799001",
    "    phone 231-5875, i.e. 0381 2315875   [westtripura.nic.in/public-utility/igm-hospital]",
    "  AGMC & GB Pant Hospital, Kunjaban, Agartala 799006",
    "    0381 2357130 / 0381 2356701          [agmc.ac.in/contact-us]",
    "    department list                       [agmc.ac.in/department_overview]",
    "    OPD registration 8am-3pm              [health.tripura.gov.in]",
    "  Tripura Medical College & Dr. BRAM Teaching Hospital, Hapania 799014",
    "    0381 2374155                          [westtripura.nic.in — public utility listing]",
    "  ILS Hospitals, Capital Complex Extension, Agartala 799010",
    "    0381 2415000, emergency 8974050300, 24x7 emergency & trauma, speciality",
    "    list                                  [ilshospitals.com/hospital/agartala]",
    "    switchboard cross-checked as 241-5000 [westtripura.nic.in]",
    "",
    "ASSUMED, and marked 'CHECK' on the entry itself so it shows on the card:",
    "  - Government OPD runs Mon-Sat 8am-3pm and is closed Sunday. Sourced for",
    "    AGMC, assumed for IGM and TMC because it is the state pattern. Confirm",
    "    per department — in practice consultation often runs past 3pm.",
    "  - Casualty is 24 hours at IGM, AGMC and TMC. Near-certain for hospitals of",
    "    this size, but only ILS publishes it in writing.",
    "  - IGM's department list comes from directory sites, not from a government",
    "    page. IGM publishes no department list of its own. The four listed are",
    "    the ones a 608-bed state hospital certainly runs, but confirm before use.",
    "  - Languages are Tripura's official and common languages, not a checked",
    "    claim about who is on duty. Bengali is safe everywhere; Kokborok is",
    "    listed for government hospitals, where it is far likelier to be spoken.",
    "",
    "NO HOURS ON THE ILS ENTRIES, ON PURPOSE",
    "ILS publishes its speciality list but not day-wise OPD timings — those are",
    "behind an appointment line. Those cards will read 'Hours not listed', which",
    "is true. Inventing clinic hours would mark a department open when it is shut,",
    "which is the one failure mode this file exists to avoid. Ring 0381 2415000",
    "and fill them in.",
    "",
    "DELIBERATELY NOT INCLUDED",
    "  Personal mobiles for the AGMC Principal and admissions authority surface in",
    "  search results. They are published for administration, not for patients.",
    "  Only institutional switchboards are used here.",
    "",
    "COORDINATES are null throughout, so nothing is distance-sorted yet. Mapping",
    "sites will hand you a lat/lng for all four, but a coordinate that is a little",
    "bit wrong puts a hospital on the wrong road while looking perfectly correct.",
    "Right-click each in Google Maps, copy the pair, paste it into every entry",
    "sharing that campus. Four lookups covers the whole file.",
    "",
    "Helplines are NOT here: 112, 108/102, 104 and Tele-MANAS 14416 live in",
    "contacts.py and are shown with every triage result already.",
    "",
    "COORDINATES",
    "One per campus, since entries share sites. Four decimal places is about",
    "11 m, far finer than a straight-line directory ranking needs.",
    "",
    "  IGM Hospital, AK Road          23.8308, 91.2760",
    "  AGMC & GB Pant, Kunjaban       23.8603, 91.2928",
    "  TMC & BRAM, Hapania            23.7847, 91.2592",
    "  ILS Hospitals, Capital Complex 23.8675, 91.2896",
    "",
    "TMC is the most solid: Wikipedia's 23 deg 47'06\"N 91 deg 15'32\"E, a mappls",
    "record and latlong.net all agree. ILS is confirmed by two independent",
    "mappls records. IGM and AGMC rest on a single source each.",
    "",
    "CHECK ALL FOUR ON A MAP BEFORE ANYONE RELIES ON THEM. A coordinate that is",
    "slightly wrong puts a hospital on the wrong road while looking perfectly",
    "correct, and the app will confidently rank it as nearest. This is not",
    "hypothetical: a search for IGM Hospital returned 23.49, 91.16 — inside",
    "India, the right way round, passing every per-entry check in",
    "check_doctors.py, and roughly 39 km away past the Bangladesh border. It was",
    "caught only by comparing it against the other entries, which is what the",
    "outlier check in check_doctors.py now does on every run.",
    "",
    "Modern Psychiatric Hospital, Narsingarh has no coordinate on purpose. No",
    "source gives one — only prose about sitting east of the airport — and a",
    "coordinate derived from that would look exactly as authoritative as a real",
    "one. The card reads without a distance, which is true, and the entry still",
    "sorts into the directory rather than being hidden."
  ],
